THE REMAINING SOFTWARE IDEA (not attempted, arithmetic in bench/FINDINGS.md)
Give the expert cache a host-memory home the GPU can read in place
(cudaHostAllocMapped behind a ggml CUDA buffer type) instead of a VRAM cache filled
by per-layer copies: 70% free VRAM hits + 20% read over PCIe at ~11 GB/s (16 ms) +
